{"speciesId":432,"names":{"fr":"Chaffreux","es":"Purugly","en":"Purugly","ja":"ブニャット"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is a brazen brute that barges its way into another Pokémon’s nest and claims it as its own."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"To make itself appear intimidatingly beefy, it tightly cinches its waist with its twin tails."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It would claim another Pokémon’s nest as its own if it finds a nest sufficiently comfortable."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It would claim another Pokémon’s nest as its own if it finds a nest sufficiently comfortable."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il plaque ses queues contre son dos pour paraître plus grand. Il soutient un regard des heures."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il plaque ses queues contre son dos pour paraître plus grand. Il soutient un regard des heures."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il n’hésitera pas à voler le nid d’autres Pokémon et à s’y installer si celui-ci est confortable."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si se siente a gusto, no tiene ningún reparo en apropiarse de las moradas de otros Pokémon."},{"language":"